SUMMARY:Red Bull Room Tequila & Mezcal Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Tequila & Mezcal Tasting \n\n\n\nMcNear’s • Red Bull Room • Wilibees Wine & Spirits Petaluma \n\n\n\nJoin us in the Red Bull Room at McNear’s for a special Tequila & Mezcal Tasting Night on Tuesday\, June 16\, 2026—an elevated evening of bold flavors\, premium spirits\, and expertly paired cuisine. This curated experience features standout pours including G4 Blanco and Reposado Tequilas\, ArteNOM 1146 Añejo\, Palomo Espadín Mezcal\, and Las Marías Salmiana Mezcal\, each thoughtfully paired with a five-course chef-driven menu. \n\n\n\nFrom Brentwood corn esquites with chicharron and halibut aguachile with habanero-pineapple salsa\, to a bone-in pork chop al pastor and a decadent Oaxacan sundae with mezcal float\, every course is designed to complement and enhance the tasting journey. \n\n\n\nWith limited seating in an intimate setting\, this is a one-night-only experience for those who appreciate exceptional food and world-class agave spirits. \n\n\n\nCost per person includes tax and gratuity. \n\n\n\nMENU- \n\n\n\n1st Course \n\n\n\nChicharron -Brentwood corn esquites\, BBQ\, epazote\, queso cotija\, cilantro aioli \n\n\n\n2nd Course \n\n\n\nHalibut Aqua Chili  -Habanero + pineapple salsa\, tostada crisp\, avocado puree\, pickled onion\, radish\, mandarin \n\n\n\n3rd Course \n\n\n\nLA Wedge- Baby iceberg\, chili spiced bacon\, heirloom tomato\, queso fresco\, crispy onion\, chives\, jalapeno buttermilk dressing \n\n\n\n4th Course \n\n\n\nPork Chop Pastor-Bone in achiote pork chop\, charred pineapple\, Pt Reyes toma grits\, asparagus ala plancha\, pork + pineapple jus \n\n\n\n5th Course \n\n\n\nOaxacan Sundae -Valley Ford salted caramel soft serve\, churro cumble\, mango\, passion fruit mezcal float\, black lime salt. \n\n\n\nVery limited seating. This event sells out frequently. \n\n\n\n$75 per person – includes tax and tip. Grab tickets at McNear’s bar to avoid online service fees.
URL:https://www.mcnears.com/event/mcnears-red-bull-room-tequila-mezcal-tasting/
END:VEVENT
